# =============================================================================
# Files NOT uploaded to Vercel.
# Deployment is purely static (viewer/ only). Everything below is local
# pipeline / venv / docs that the edge doesn't need.
#
# IMPORTANT: leading "/" anchors a pattern to the project root, so
#   /data/   = only top-level data/ folder
#   data/    = ANY data folder (including viewer/data/) <- WOULD BREAK THE BUILD
# =============================================================================

# Python pipeline + environment (anchored: only at root)
/.venv/
/__pycache__/
/landslide/
/make_docx.py
/run_pipeline.py
*.pyc

# Pipeline raw + intermediate data (NOT viewer/data/)
/data/

# Documentation source
/docs/

# Local pipeline config
/config.yaml
/note.txt
/requirements.txt
/pyproject.toml

# Misc
*.jsonl
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
